7, "endText": "23:42", "widthPercent": 42.26273959794297, "stage": "core", "startPercent": 0, "vitals": {"maxHeartRate": 59, "avgRespiratoryRate": 15.5, "avgHeartRate": 55.75, "minHeartRate": 54}}, {"startText": "23:42", "start": 1778254967, "end": 1778255118, "endText": "23:45", "widthPercent": 7.059373539036932, "stage": "awake", "startPercent": 42.26273959794297}, {"startText": "23:45", "start": 1778255118, "end": 1778256202, "endText": "00:03", "widthPercent": 50.677886863020106, "stage": "core", "startPercent": 49.322113136979894, "vitals": {"maxHeartRate": 55, "avgRespiratoryRate": 15, "avgHeartRate": 54.666666666666664, "minHeartRate": 54}}], "stages": {"awake": 3, "deep": 0, "unspecified": 0, "core": 33, "rem": 0}}]}, "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_jhr6siwzsz83bf9p4bayehow"}, "updatedAt": "2026-05-09T07:32:15.386Z", "kind": "sleepVisualization"}, {"id": "14590FB4-65F9-4953-B56E-7D2A09558E15", "kind": "text", "text": "你昨天（5月8日）的睡眠总时长仅35分钟，其中有效睡眠（核心睡眠）33分钟，清醒占比8.4%，没有深度和REM睡眠，属于严重睡眠不足哦。\n\n建议你今天适当调整作息，尽量在23点前准备入睡，避免睡前使用电子设备，若持续出现短睡眠情况，建议排查是否有睡眠节律紊乱或其他影响睡眠的因素~", "createdAt": "2026-05-09T07:32:39.463Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-09T07:32:42.849Z"}], "thread_max_tokens": 4096, "role": "assistant", "tombstone": false, "created_at": "2026-05-09T07:32:10.865Z", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "delivery_state": "pending", "thread_top_p": 1, "thread_role_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}", "thread_current_model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "DC29FBFC-22BD-45B0-BC22-2F6D386A1B46", "thread_system_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215"}, {"thread_id": "A984BCCD-73F5-48FC-9DEC-7150CFBE608F", "thread_max_messages": 20, "blocks": [{"updatedAt": "2026-05-09T07:33:21.675Z", "id": "D67AF814-78B1-47E3-8692-3974E2AC2BC5", "text": "昨天睡眠情况怎么样", "kind": "text", "createdAt": "2026-05-09T07:33:21.675Z"}], "thread_max_tokens": 4096, "r